#{\footnote # moving}${\footnote $ Moving Through Help}K{\footnote K Moving Through Help}+{\footnote + procedures:010}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 Moving Through Help}\par
\pard\li120\sa120 Index opens the index; Back returns to previous topics. Browse << and Browse >> step through related topics. Click an underlined link to open its topic.\par
\page
#{\footnote # searching}${\footnote $ Searching for a Topic}K{\footnote K Searching for a Topic}+{\footnote + procedures:020}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 Searching for a Topic}\par
\pard\li120\sa60\sb60{\b To search}\par
\pard\li360\fi-240\sa60 1.\tab Choose Search.\par
2.\tab Type a word or select one from the list, and choose Show Topics.\par
3.\tab Select a topic and choose Go To.\par
